ki_tis_polis_pitta","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["tokalamakitispolispitta","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Very delicious food, nicely arranged. Very authentic and friendly owner. Super helpful and friendly staff who explain the menu and variety of options - you get skewers, different sizes of pita or a meal with fries and salad. There are options for vegetarians too (grilled haloumi)! You can see locals eat here too.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_happy_island_restaurant","areaId":"paphos","name":"Happy Island Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75478,"lng":32.41953},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_happy_island_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["happyislandrestaurant","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Complimentary warm breads, fruit and brandy/liqueur to finish off a delicious meal of moussaka and sheftalia. From start to finish, all the staff is friendly, funny, warm and attentive. Moussaka and stifado are excellent and with generous portions. Everything tastes fresh and flavourful throughout the meal.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_leonidas","areaId":"paphos","name":"Leonidas","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75571,"lng":32.41446},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_leonidas","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["leonidaspaphos","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A typical tourist attraction. It is famous for its delicious steaks but if you order any seafood you will not be disappointed either. You may fall in love with the delicious tartare. The service is very friendly and helpful. Make sure to order one of the wines. The staff is nice.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_tramps_bar","areaId":"paphos","name":"Tramps Bar","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.77083,"lng":32.41056},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_tramps_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["trampsbar","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Food is delicious. A really friendly atmosphere and great service, the owner Michael makes you very welcome and is good to chat to. Tbone steak is cooked perfectly and the same thing can be said about the Moussaka. Altogether a great experience. Lovely food and good staff.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_lighthouse_beach_snack_bar","areaId":"paphos","name":"Lighthouse Beach Snack Bar","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.76451,"lng":32.407},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_lighthouse_beach_snack_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lighthousebeachsnackbar","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Right on the beach, amazing sea and lighthouse view, quite good cocktails and snacks. About €5 (Nov 2022) for a burger or common foods. The halloumi sandwich is really delicious. Quite secluded and beautiful beach. Ideal for a nice relaxing place to unwind. Fast service.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_chef_s_garden","areaId":"paphos","name":"Chef's Garden","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75933,"lng":32.41298},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_chef_s_garden","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["chefsgarden","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Great food. Great service. The bacon cheese burger is amazing. The staff is friendly, very welcomeing. The best full English breakfast. Great atmosphere. Everything cooked fresh in front of you with beautiful ingredients well sauced. This place is a hidden gem.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_burger_kato_pafos","areaId":"paphos","name":"Burger Kato Pafos","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75681,"lng":32.41637},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_burger_kato_pafos","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["burgerkatopafos","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A little taste of home. Mouthwatering and delicious burgers. Burgers, absolute perfection, juicy, light, perfect balance. Wings, crunchy on the outside, juicy on the inside and sauces were spot on. Ribs, just right, perfect combination of grilling and glazing.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_friends_bar","areaId":"paphos","name":"Friends Bar","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75807,"lng":32.41658},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_friends_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["friendsbar","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The chicken curry is to be enjoyed. Nice bar to relax. Wonderful friendly atmosphere. The owner is always around for a chat. A variety of entertainment. Quality food. Great little place. Lovely mussels and sea bream. Tasty breakfast.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_thomas_s_jungle_pub","areaId":"paphos","name":"Thomas's Jungle Pub","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.76665,"lng":32.41036},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_thomas_s_jungle_pub","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thomassjunglepub","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Great, friendly service, delicious food, a very large selection of cocktails. This little bar is to be loved. A pleasant place to sit, a large selection of local drinks with a decent alcohol content. Average age 50+ and great fun.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_mar_bianco","areaId":"paphos","name":"Mar Bianco","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.75536,"lng":32.41285},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_mar_bianco","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["marbianco","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Restaurant on the promenade right next to the sea. Lovely location, great choice of food and drink. Friendly staff. The food is so tasty. The staff takes great care to make you feel wonderful all the time. Good fresh food.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"},{"id":"paphos_wv_the_three_little_pigs_grill_house","areaId":"paphos","name":"The Three Little Pigs Grill House","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.76604,"lng":32.41075},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"paphos_wv_the_three_little_pigs_grill_house","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thethreelittlepigsgrillhouse","paphos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Very good food. If you are looking for a place to eat local food on the go, you have come to the right place. Good quality. The portions are big. Food is fresh and well prepared. Delicious meat, lots of variety, very fast.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Paphos"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}